; Static environment-mapped strips (VU1EnvStrip, render.c ENVSTRIP_PROGRAM): as VU1Strip with the normals where the
; UVs were (+82 .. +161, UNPACK V4-8 signed x 127); STQ from the normal as VU1Env (the clip matrix's columns, then the
; texgen at VU mem 8..10 and 15). Two vertices per loop.
